%N A399435 a(n) is the numerator of the probability that two heads will turn up in succession in tossing n times a coin.
%D A399435 Răzvan Gelca and Titu Andreescu, Putnam and Beyond, Springer 2007, pp. 318, 781.
%F A399435 a(n) = numerator(1 - F(n+2)/2^n).
%t A399435 a[n_]:=Numerator[1-Fibonacci[n+2]/2^n]; Array[a,35]
